<title>USA: MidAmerican Energy name changes.</title>
<headline>MidAmerican Energy name changes.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES, Iowa 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>MidAmerican Energy Co said trading of its stock began Monday under a new corporate name, MidAmerican Energy Holdings Co.</p>
<p>The company's shareholders approved formation of the holding company in April 1996, and state and federal regulatory agencies also approved the change.</p>
<p>Each share of MidAmerican common automatically will become one share of the holding company's stock.</p>
<p>MidAmerican manages nonregulated businessess involved in railcar management and repair, electric and natural gas marketing, communications and passive investments.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
